Third-party data
----------------
DataQuests.lua, DataNpcs.lua, DataObjects.lua, DataItems.lua and DataZones.lua are converted
from the QuestieDB project's World of Warcraft: Forever data (https://github.com/Questie/QuestieDB),
which its maintainers permit to be copied under the GPLv3. The QuestieDB maintainers note that
some historic contributions have no recorded license; see their LICENSE.md. This addon is not
affiliated with or endorsed by the Questie project and does not use the Questie name or logo.
